@startuml
!include business_symbols.iuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #315E57
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #7A9892
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor transparent
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #173F39
skinparam ActorBorderColor #315E57
skinparam ActorFontColor #173F39
skinparam EntityBorderColor #315E57
skinparam EntityFontColor #173F39
hide footbox

participant "<$business_worker>\n门店员工" as Clerk
participant "<$business_entity>\nExcel 工作簿" as Excel
participant "<$business_entity>\n纸质维修登记簿" as Paper
participant "<$business_actor>\n维修承包商" as Repairer

Clerk -> Clerk : 发现装备故障并进行初步检查()
activate Clerk
Clerk -> Excel : 查询装备编号、位置和出租状态()
activate Excel
Excel --> Clerk : 返回可能滞后的装备记录
deactivate Excel
Clerk -> Paper : 填写维修登记(装备、故障、日期)
activate Paper
Paper --> Clerk : 返回纸质维修编号
deactivate Paper

Clerk -> Repairer : 电话报修并约定交接(维修编号、故障描述)
activate Repairer
Repairer --> Clerk : 返回接单和预计完成时间
Clerk -> Repairer : 线下交接故障装备()
Repairer --> Clerk : 电话反馈维修进度和完成结果
deactivate Repairer
Clerk -> Clerk : 人工复核装备安全状况()
Clerk -> Paper : 登记维修结果和检查结论()
activate Paper
Paper --> Clerk : 返回登记完成
deactivate Paper
Clerk -> Excel : 手工更新维修状态和装备可租状态()
activate Excel
Excel --> Clerk : 返回保存结果
deactivate Excel
deactivate Clerk

@enduml
